							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">- It is now possible to display your mana as a numeric value on your inventory screen. *<br />- By mousing over your buff icons, you will now be able to see the buffs remaining duration. *</div><br />Thank you, SoE, for finally doing something you should have done 5 years ago!
						</td>
