							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=932.msg9355#msg9355"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=932.msg9355#msg9355">Re: Patch Message 7/14</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #12 on:</b> July 17, 2004, 06:38:38 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Ok I got this from Medikal but here ya go with link and all.......................<br /><br />_____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________<br /><br /><a href="http://eqcleric.gameglow.com/forums/showthread.php?t=19199" target="_blank">http://eqcleric.gameglow.com/forums/showthread.php?t=19199</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;(<span style="color: Purple;">Link to post on this</span>)<br /><br />*make a back up copy of the file before you modify it* <br /><br />Steps are: <br />1.) Save the txt file to your computer. <br />2.) Open the EQUI_Playerwindow.xml <br />3.) Find the sections the following sections and add them near simular tags in your UI file. <br /><br />xml section: Lable (copy from the first line where the tag starts utill the closing tag) <br />Label item=&quot;MANANumberCur&quot; <br />Label item=&quot;MANASlash&quot; <br />Label item=&quot;MANANumberMax&quot; <br /><br />xml section: Pieces (copy the whole line) <br />MANANumberCur <br />MANASlash <br />MANANumberMax <br /><br />4.) Try loading the UI. <br /><br />You can adjust the location of the text with the x and y tags that are nestled in the LABEL tag that you want to move. The same for the r b g color tags in the LABLE tag. 
						</td>
					</tr>
